{
  "dashboard": {
    "title": "线程池拒绝策略监控面板",
    "tags": ["thread-pool", "rejection", "platform"],
    "timezone": "browser",
    "schemaVersion": 38,
    "version": 2,
    "description": "指标名/label 真相源 = deploy/prometheus/expected-metric-names.txt（真起上下文抓 /actuator/prometheus 实采，禁止手抄）。拒绝计数导出名 async_task_rejected_total（label: executor, policy, application）；线程池状态由 ExecutorServiceMetrics 绑定，导出族 executor_active_threads / executor_queued_tasks / executor_pool_size_threads / executor_pool_max_threads / executor_pool_core_threads / executor_queue_remaining_tasks / executor_completed_tasks_total，其池名 label 是 name（不是 executor）。旧面板查 executor_threads_active / executor_queue_size / executor_threads_max / executor_queue_remaining 属推断名，恒 No data（TASK-16 修）。name 有两套取值：platform-* 来自本仓 TaskExecutorMetricsBinder（线程名前缀），*TaskExecutor 来自 Spring Boot 对容器内 Executor 的自动绑定，同一线程池被双份记录；本面板按 name=~\"platform-.*\" 只看平台池。",
    "panels": [
      {
        "id": 1,
        "title": "异步任务拒绝计数趋势",
        "type": "graph",
        "gridPos": {"x": 0, "y": 0, "w": 12, "h": 8},
        "targets": [
          {
            "expr": "increase(async_task_rejected_total[5m])",
            "legendFormat": "{{executor}} - {{policy}}",
            "refId": "A"
          }
        ],
        "annotations": {
          "list": [
            {
              "enabled": true,
              "name": "告警事件",
              "icon": "fa-exclamation-triangle"
            }
          ]
        },
        "thresholds": [
          {"color": "green", "value": 0},
          {"color": "#E0B400", "value": 10},
          {"color": "#BF1B00", "value": 50}
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": 2,
        "title": "各执行器拒绝次数排名",
        "type": "bargauge",
        "gridPos": {"x": 12, "y": 0, "w": 12, "h": 8},
        "targets": [
          {
            "expr": "sum(increase(async_task_rejected_total[1h])) by (executor)",
            "legendFormat": "{{executor}}",
            "refId": "A"
          }
        ],
        "thresholds": [
          {"color": "green", "value": 0},
          {"color": "#E0B400", "value": 100},
          {"color": "#BF1B00", "value": 500}
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": 3,
        "title": "当前活跃线程数",
        "type": "gauge",
        "gridPos": {"x": 0, "y": 8, "w": 6, "h": 6},
        "targets": [
          {
            "expr": "executor_active_threads{name=~\"platform-.*\"}",
            "legendFormat": "{{name}}",
            "refId": "A"
          }
        ],
        "max": 100
      },
      {
        "id": 4,
        "title": "队列等待任务数",
        "type": "gauge",
        "gridPos": {"x": 6, "y": 8, "w": 6, "h": 6},
        "targets": [
          {
            "expr": "executor_queued_tasks{name=~\"platform-.*\"}",
            "legendFormat": "{{name}}",
            "refId": "A"
          }
        ],
        "max": 200
      },
      {
        "id": 5,
        "title": "拒绝策略分布",
        "type": "piechart",
        "gridPos": {"x": 12, "y": 8, "w": 6, "h": 6},
        "targets": [
          {
            "expr": "sum(increase(async_task_rejected_total[24h])) by (policy)",
            "legendFormat": "{{policy}}",
            "refId": "A"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": 6,
        "title": "平台线程池状态总览",
        "type": "table",
        "gridPos": {"x": 18, "y": 8, "w": 6, "h": 6},
        "targets": [
          {
            "expr": "{__name__=~\"executor_active_threads|executor_pool_size_threads|executor_queue_remaining_tasks\",name=~\"platform-.*\"}",
            "format": "table",
            "instant": true,
            "refId": "A"
          }
        ],
        "transformations": [
          {"id": "organize", "options": {"renameByName": {"Value": "数值", "__name__": "指标名称"}}}
        ]
      }
    ],
    "time": {"from": "now-1h", "to": "now"},
    "refresh": "30s"
  }
}
